    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shiinū ibīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla nabona shiinū yabumbūka kūfuma ū mu nyanza, yalī na mapembe ikūmi na mitwe mpungatī. A ha mapembe gayo yalī na ngikili ikūmi, alīyo būlī ntwe gwalī na lina lya būsondagūji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiinū īyo nakībona yenīyo yalī ībange sūbī, lelo a magūlū gayo gaalī gītī ga ndūba, alīyo ū nomo gītī gwa shimba. Ū būsugi walyo ī Līshing'weng'we lyīyinha ī shiinū yenīyo, pyī nī lisumbī lyalyo lya būtemi; lyīyinha na būdūla būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiinū yenīyo ū ntwe gwayo ū gūmò gwalī n'igulagīje lya kūdūla kwenheleja kūcha; alīyo ī ligulagīje lya kūdūla kwenheleja kūcha lyenīlo, lyalī lyapīla. Pye a ba mu sī būjinjimala bandya kwīlondeela ī shiinū yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būyūlīlamya ī Līshing'weng'we, nguno līkayinha būdūla ī shiinū yenīyo. Nī yoi ī shiinū būyūyīlamya, ū kūnū balīhaya gīkī, “Nani ū wa kūlenganīla nayo ī shiinū yenīyī? Nani ūyo adūgije kwilwisha nayo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shiinū yenīyo īkinhwa būdūla bo kūhaya na nomo gwayo mihayo ya magaka na ya būsondagūji; yinhwa ikanza lya myeji makūmi ane n'bīlī, lya kūbūtūmamīla ū būdūla wayo ū kwīta ī gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna yandya kūgūtūmamīla ū nomo gwayo kūnsondagūla ū Mulungu, na kūlīsondagūla ī lina lyakwe nū wikalo bokwe, pye na a bikaji ba ng'wigūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yinhwa na būdūla bo kwilwisha nabo a beela kūshisha kūbapyena, na būdūla higūlya ya ng'anda jose ja banhū, na ndīmi ja mahanga gose na gose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū a bikaji ba mu sī bakwīlamya ī shiinū yenīyo; pye a bose, būlī ng'wene ūyo lina lyakwe lītandīkilwe mu shitabo sha būpanga ī sha Ng'wana wa Ng'holo ūyo wasīnzwa kale, kūfuma ha kūseeng'wa kwa sī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla nabona shiinū yīngī yagulumūka kūfuma mu gatī ya sī, yalī na mapembe abīlī gītī ga Ng'wana wa Ng'holo, gwike a kayombele kayo kaalī gīt'ūmo līkayombelaga ī Līshing'weng'we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo yatūmamaga mu būdūla bose ūbo yalī nabo ī shiinū ī ya kwandya; yūyīta pyī ī sī na a bikaji baamo kūbiza balamya bayo ī shiinū ī ya kwandya, īyo igulagīje lyayo lya kūdūla kwenheleja kūcha lyalī lyapīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yandya kūbeeja maleeba mataale; yūyenha na moto kūfuma kwigūlū gwika mu sī a banhū balolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūyūbalemba lemaba a bikaji ba mu sī kūlwa nguno ya maleeba ayo īkinhwa būdūla bo kūgabeeja, kūlwa kwītūmamīla ī shiinū ī ya kwandya; yūyūbawīla kūbeeja shiikolile sha shiinū īyo yalī n'igulagīje lya līlūshū, alīyo yalī ītaalī mhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yinhwa na būdūla bo kūshinha myūyī ī shiikolile sha shiinū, gīkī ī shiikolile shenīsho shidūle kūyomba. Na hangī yūbiza na būdūla bo kūbenheleja kūbūlagwa pye abo bakūlema kūshilamya ī shiikolile sha shiinū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yūlagīla gīkī pye a banhū batūūlīlwe lūmeng'ho ha nkono gwa būlyo, nūūlū ha būshū wabo; pye a bose bado na bataale, basabi na bahabī, babize balī mu wiyabī nūūlū mu būsese; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na gīkī atizilonga ose ose wa kūgūla nūūlū kūjinja ūlū atī nalo ū lūmeng'ho; ūlū atī nalyo ī lina lyayo nūūlū ī lisaabu lyayo ī shiinū yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mhayo gwenūyū galīgongwa masala madeekanu; ūyo alī na witegeleja ni alībeejage ī lisaabu lyayo ī shiinū yenīyo, nguno līlī isaabu lya ng'wa munhū. Ī lisaabu lyenekīlī līlī magana atandatū na makūmi atandatū n'itandatū (666)!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
